WEBVTT

00:01.720 --> 00:03.120
Your Majesty, wait

00:03.920 --> 00:04.920
Just now

00:05.000 --> 00:06.400
Prince of Jin said

00:06.480 --> 00:08.040
To mobilize the entire nation's strength

00:08.120 --> 00:09.120
Your subject believes

00:09.280 --> 00:10.680
That's not necessary

00:10.760 --> 00:11.240
Your subject

00:11.400 --> 00:13.680
Can reduce the required horses and supplies

00:14.120 --> 00:15.520
To thirty percent

00:16.080 --> 00:17.800
And still go north

00:18.040 --> 00:19.440
Thirty percent

00:20.720 --> 00:22.480
That reduces the pressure considerably

00:22.560 --> 00:23.640
But your subject

00:23.720 --> 00:26.000
Boldly asks Your Majesty for one person

00:26.200 --> 00:27.600
Who?

00:28.880 --> 00:30.280
Prince of Jin

00:31.600 --> 00:33.000
Second son

00:39.680 --> 00:40.400
These words

00:40.480 --> 00:41.840
You've all heard

00:41.920 --> 00:43.360
What do you think?

00:44.640 --> 00:45.280
Your son

00:45.360 --> 00:47.000
Is willing to assist the general

00:47.080 --> 00:48.280
If after all this trouble

00:48.360 --> 00:50.840
We waste effort and money with no good result

00:50.920 --> 00:52.640
Watch your head

00:55.240 --> 00:56.200
Father

00:56.280 --> 00:57.320
Your son believes

00:57.400 --> 00:59.640
Sending second brother is a good thing

00:59.720 --> 01:00.560
If successful

01:00.640 --> 01:02.080
The credit goes to Father

01:02.160 --> 01:03.080
If we fail

01:03.200 --> 01:04.640
The credit goes to Father

01:04.720 --> 01:05.680
The blame is on

01:05.760 --> 01:07.160
Your son

01:08.720 --> 01:09.680
Enough

01:09.760 --> 01:11.800
All the unpleasant things have been said

01:11.880 --> 01:13.120
Let's be merry

01:13.200 --> 01:14.600
Continue the celebration

01:23.320 --> 01:24.680
Come

01:24.760 --> 01:26.427
Let's drink this cup together

01:35.480 --> 01:37.120
Everything is finally resolved

01:38.680 --> 01:40.680
With this opportunity to go north

01:40.880 --> 01:42.547
I can accumulate military achievements

01:42.680 --> 01:44.080
Bit by bit

01:44.480 --> 01:45.880
Turn the situation around

01:53.600 --> 01:54.640
I see Your Highness at the banquet

01:54.720 --> 01:56.120
Drank quite a bit

01:57.760 --> 01:59.120
Freshly warmed hangover soup

